@guestToken = Bearer replace-me
@tableId = replace-me
@copyId = replace-me

### Create booking
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/bookings
Authorization: {{guestToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tableId": "{{tableId}}",
  "gameCopyId": "{{copyId}}",
  "startAt": "2026-09-01T12:00:00Z",
  "endAt": "2026-09-01T14:00:00Z",
  "guestCount": 2
}

### My bookings
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/bookings/me?page=0&size=20
Authorization: {{guestToken}}

### Cancel
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel
Authorization: {{guestToken}}
